User Site

> You get one user site per Github account. This is where you could host a portfolio site
  or some for of personal website. The default url is based on your Github username, following
  this pattern: username.github.io though you can change this!

Project Sites

> You get unlimited project sites! Each Github repo can have a corresponding hosted websites.
  It's a simple as telling Github which specific branch contains the web contains.
  The default url follow this pattern: username.github.io/repo-name